  {
   "id": "rule-no-1-146645@1.1",
   "gameId": "rule-no-1-146645",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.1",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2021-07-19T23:00:00.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Heyo! Some much welcome fixes are now live!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Came up with a solution for runs that would be unplayable due to stuck/hidden enemies. If the wave is near the end and there are stuck enemies, wait 10 seconds and they will be destroyed, allowing the player and waves to progress.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix for God Stiletto weapon getting stuck and not being able to fire (Pistol swap).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Zombie Audio properly added to Sound Effects slider.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Rule's Enemy Kill VO default volume raised.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Enemy(s) VO default volume raised or lowered.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixes to the Arcade Leaderboard. This will accompany a complete reset of this Leaderboard only.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "An escape function from the game summary screen (death) so you won't have to start a fresh game before quitting to the menu any longer.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Some optimisations to back-end.: Let us know if anything breaks! ; ): -- Oddkins, Director, Walk Without Rhythm Games.: : )",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
