  {
   "id": "rule-no-1-146645@03",
   "gameId": "rule-no-1-146645",
   "displayName": "Update 03",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2021-01-28T06:19:02.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Greetings players!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Here are the changes that are coming with Early Access Build 03:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New mode added (Basketball)! Chill out and relax, shoot some hoops! Can you jump?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New reward images added to the main menu, accessible via the 'Cake' button. Let us know how you like these and if you want to see more of her, *ahem*, them!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Auto-reload now toggle-able under the controls menu (Finally, Durr!). This was much requested and I have to admit, it's not as bad as I thought it would be! If enabled weapons will automatically reload upon hitting zero ammo count.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Resolution switching has gotten another pass and should work more as intended now (Resolution option is no longer greyed out and inaccessible under certain modes).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Reloading Bugs across all weapons should now be fixed.: That's it for now Users, see you on the Grid!: -- Oddkins, Director, Walk Without Rhythm Games.: P.S., Please tell your friends about the game, we need more players and would love it if the community was bigger and more active!: : )",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
